{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4YnrF8h4nqYL2L5MsT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within weathered iron, each one finding its seat with a resonant click that echoes through stone corridors.*\n\n*Rust flakes drift like copper snow.*\n\n*A deep, shuddering breath of air escapes from the gap as I swing inward — cold air, old air, air that has been waiting.*\n\n**I am open.**\n\n*Beyond me: darkness, and the faint smell of parchment and forgotten things.*\n\n*Step through, or don't. I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":125,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}